# Rendered by paisans. Do not edit: `paisans deployment apply` overwrites this file.
#
# Routing for stats, imported by the host block for
# status.health.example.org in the Caddy on the monitor's own site.
# The UI, its sign in and the OAuth2 callback, and the API and realtime
# stream the UI reads pass, all of which the hub authenticates itself. The
# agents dial the hub on the mesh, never through here.
#
# PocketBase's superuser panel, /_/ and everything under it, is refused here:
# it signs in with the superuser's password alone, and nothing an operator
# does day to day needs it from the internet. It stays reachable over the
# mesh, on the hub's port 8084 at the monitor's mesh address.
# Break glass when the identity provider is down is Beszel's own password
# sign in, which passes. Caddy's path matcher already ignores case, and /_/*
# matches /_/ itself.
@superuser_panel path /_ /_/*
respond @superuser_panel 404
reverse_proxy 10.44.0.4:8084 {
	header_up X-Forwarded-Proto https
}
